# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outofrange is project
outofrange purpose "Read past the end of a list with getOrTrap, so the trap can be compared; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
outofrange target console
outofrange version "0.1.0"
outofrange language refined 1
outofrange standardLibrary 1
outofrange allows write console.stdout none
outofrange requires none
outofrange includesModule outofrange
outofrange entry outofrange.main
